- Good for you.

00:20:33.800 --> 00:20:36.760
- So at Nabisco and then
a Campbell I hit my stride

00:20:39.054 --> 00:20:40.839
and it became one.

00:20:40.839 --> 00:20:44.520
What I do today I live for my resume

