and I'm looking and--

00:20:56.870 --> 00:20:59.720
- The awesome Amy is truly awesome.

00:20:59.720 --> 00:21:02.160
I'll tell you, I'm a
68 year old white guy.

00:21:02.160 --> 00:21:03.545
- [Gary] I've heard.

00:21:03.545 --> 00:21:06.210
- And I'm writing this
book and I would write it

00:21:06.210 --> 00:21:08.830
like a 68 year old white guy.

00:21:08.830 --> 00:21:09.680
- [Gary] Respect.

00:21:11.214 --> 00:21:13.980
- The book is designed and
we'll talk about in a minute

00:21:13.980 --> 00:21:17.640
to be approachable for
anyone and I needed help

00:21:17.640 --> 00:21:20.602
